{"content":[{"c":["SHABBETHAI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Levite who opposed Ezra’s suggestion that the sons of Israel should divorce the foreign women they had married upon returning to Palestine from exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.15","r":"Ezra.10.15","rawR":"Ezra.10.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.15","value":"Ezra.10.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:15"},"). He explained the law to the people at Ezra’s reading (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.7","r":"Neh.8.7","rawR":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.7","value":"Neh.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 8:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the chiefs of the Levites who oversaw the outside work of the sanctuary during the postexilic period (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.16","r":"Neh.11.16","rawR":"Neh.11.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.16","value":"Neh.11.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:16"},"). He is perhaps identical with #1 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shabbethai","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.15","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.15","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.15"},{"anchorText":"Neh 8:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.8.7","rawQueryValue":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefExact":"Neh.8.7"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.16","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.16","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.16"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"9e0f20feea56d0858e17a58ce461a1c34b8a8ae19aa907873429ccb8a3d105e9","sourceItemName":"Shabbethai","sourceItemOrder":180,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Shabbethai","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Shabbethai","title":"Shabbethai","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}